{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52973","headline":"与郑辕崔全素游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 蒙泉 · 薛晏","name":"与郑辕崔全素游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 蒙泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啧苏出深窦，欣然傍欹壁。\n清潄疎林澄，光净寒石白。\n一劳意渴甚，挽翫此水碧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛晏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}